issues.suggestedFix:
Make the template match the UML and solution by removing or changing the two public field declarations to private and adding the missing private attributes. Concretely, in template/src/de/tum/cit/ase/Lecture.java replace the two public fields with the five private declarations:

private String lectureName;
private int numberOfInscribedStudents;
private int numberOfGuestStudents;
private int numberOfLecturers;
private int numberOfTutors;

Keeping the attributes private preserves the intended encapsulation and lets students implement the required getters, setters, constructor, and other methods without name/visibility conflicts.
